&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;322&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;452&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in applied Data Science and AI engineering with significant hands-on work building LLM-based applications or AI agents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;608&quot;&gt;Deep practical experience with LLMs (prompt engineering, fine-tuning, model selection, and understanding trade-offs across providers and model families).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;608&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building Autonomous Agent architectures (e.g., LangGraph, multi-agent workflows, tool-calling, and state machines) and implementing rigorous evaluation frameworks (Evals, LLM-as-a-judge, benchmark suites).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;763&quot;&gt;Knowledge of programming languages that are used in AI research, such as Python, and experience with AI frameworks (e.g., Hugging Face, LangChain, OpenAI, scikit-learn, TensorFlow, PyTorch) with the ability to deliver production-ready code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;346&quot;&gt;An M.S. or Ph.D. degree in computer science, statistics, or related field OR equivalent work experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;957&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;983&quot;&gt;Experience in cybersecurity (cloud security, threat detection, investigation, or network telemetry).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;983&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed cloud systems and hands-on familiarity with cloud-native architectures at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of deep learning models and common model architecture such as transformer models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;Excellent communication (both written and verbal) and presentation skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1349&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment and come up with creative solutions to challenging problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1471&quot;&gt;About The Job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1484&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Applied Data Scientist Expert&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join us and spread the power of Wiz. As a Data Scientist you will be responsible for driving research and development of autonomous AI agents and LLM-powered systems at Wiz. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to explore, innovate, and implement AI-driven solutions to tackle emerging threats, examine cloud security features, and enhance the company’s security posture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1917&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;Lead applied research on AI agents and LLM-driven features in the Wiz platform - from autonomous threat investigation agents to AI-powered security operations workflows. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Cover a range of features, from leveraging LLMs to enhance customer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;investigation experience to novel usage of AI for cloud security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to design, build, and maintain production pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2331&quot;&gt;Work closely with the Security Research and Product teams to define research goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2416&quot;&gt;Conduct experiments and evaluate the performance of AI models, algorithms, and techniques using real-world datasets and simulated environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2561&quot;&gt;Stay abreast of cutting-edge AI methodologies, frameworks, and tools and apply them to improve security solutions&#39; accuracy, efficiency, and scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;357&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;381&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in security or security research.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;448&quot;&gt;A strong threat-modeling mindset - deep understanding of both how attackers approach complex environments and how enterprises defend them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how complex software systems are built, so you can find where they&#39;re vulnerable (Low-level, Distributed, or Core System Engineering mindset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A foundation in program analysis - parsing, compilation and static code analysis — and comfort reasoning about code as data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define and implement AI agents, and to make their output reproducible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently, prioritize, and carry complex, multi-quarter projects from concept to working production grade software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;960&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;986&quot;&gt;Security research experience in modern cloud environments (AWS, GCP, Azure, Kubernetes, etc) &lt;/span&gt;and infrastructure-as-code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with model benchmarking, evaluation, fine-tuning, and with grading agent output against ground truth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query languages for security telemetry, graph databases, or large-scale data-mining and clustering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, with a track record of shipping alongside cross-functional teams (Product, Engineering, Research).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1749&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1762&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a talented &lt;strong&gt;Applied Security Researcher &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team and play a major role in Wiz&#39;s frontier research team, enabling contextual code understanding across complex cloud deployments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous research from initial concept through PoC to product integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build threat models for AI-native and cloud-native systems: how attackers approach them, how enterprises defend them, and where the gaps are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI agents that analyze code and/or cloud infrastructure to produce specific insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and understand real-world systems from a security perspective - architecture, data flows, and source code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Product, Engineering, and Research to ship what you discover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of sales leadership experience in enterprise software, cloud infrastructure, SaaS, or cybersecurity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a second-line sales leader managing RVPs, or regional sales directors across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading a hyper-growth sales theatre and achieving significant annual revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep operational command and mastery of value-selling methodologies, specifically MEDDPICC and Command of the Message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly professional persona with polished executive presence; exceptional written and verbal communication skills with a proven ability to deliver executive-level presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of progressive sales leadership experience within fast-paced, hyper-growth Cloud Security or Cybersecurity environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record scaling an EMEA Theatre through major ARR milestones (e.g., scaling from $50M to $150M+ ARR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep operational expertise across keysub-regions (Benelux, DACH, Nordics), including an intimate understanding of regional dynamics, compliance requirements, and market maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong existing ecosystem of CISO, CIO, and executive-level customer relationships, alongside major EMEA channel partners and GSIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering directly with Product and Marketing leadership to inform global product roadmap, pricing strategies, and regional point-of-view messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is looking for an established, growth-minded sales executive to join our team as Area Vice President, Sales covering Northern and Central Europe., The AVP will set the vision and strategy leading a cross-functional team of sales leaders, account executives, and supporting functions to maximize revenue and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This leader will manage a team of Regional Vice Presidents (RVPs), driving scale, pipeline velocity, and market penetration across mature and emerging international territories. The AVP will align strategic priorities across cross-functional GTM teams, serve as the primary executive sponsor for key enterprise customer and partner relationships, and cultivate a high-performance, high-accountability sales culture across the theatre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; GTM Execution: Translate EMEA commercial strategy into an executable, localised go-to-market plan. Drive revenue growth and market share expansion while holding teams accountable to executing Wiz’s global strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Team Management: Attract, recruit, hire, and retain top-tier sales leaders (RVPs and RD’s). Provide continuous coaching and mentorship to build strong, scalable second-line leadership structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Forecasting: Maintain a rigorous operational rhythm across the Theatre. Deliver precise monthly, quarterly, and annual pipeline and revenue forecasts to executive leadership, utilizing benchmarks and metrics to track progress and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment: Collaborate closely with Solutions Engineering (SEs), Customer Success, Channel &amp;amp; Alliances, Marketing, Product, Legal, and Deal Desk to execute a unified, frictionless GTM motion across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Partner Sponsorship: Act as the primary Wiz executive spokesperson in the region. Build deep, lasting relationships and position value with CISO and C-suite executives at marquee enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultural &amp;amp; Organisational Scale: Foster a high-performance sales culture emphasising accountability, motivation, and continuous improvement across diverse cultural and regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Computer Science/Software Engineering or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience with Backend Engineering in a high-level programming language (e.g., Java, C#, Golang).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microservices based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases and message queue technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with continuous integration and deployment (CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or experience with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our expanding R&amp;amp;D team and help drive the growth of Wiz. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for developing and maintaining large-scale distributed components that power Wiz. We&#39;re looking for candidates who are passionate about tackling scaling challenges and take pride in writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code. Join us in our mission to secure the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our tech stack includes a multi-cloud architecture (Azure, AWS, GCP, OCI, Alibaba Cloud) with Golang, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, Neptune, Docker, Kubernetes, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end development of backend software components (research, design, development, testing, rollout, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to technological and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting design and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing and improving efficiency, scalability, and stability of various backend system components.&lt;/li&gt;
