&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;732&quot;&gt;1+ years of sales and lead generation experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;783&quot;&gt;Experience in cold-calling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;812&quot;&gt;CRM experience (Salesforce, HubSpot).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;851&quot;&gt;Process and detail-oriented.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;881&quot;&gt;&quot;Get the job done&quot; attitude.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;911&quot;&gt;Ability to hit and exceed sales targets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;953&quot;&gt;Excited about building a pipeline of prospective customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;In this role, you will report to the Manager of Business Development. You will work alongside a team of Wizards that focus on our customer&#39;s business needs. Wiz business development representatives are highly motivated and will work closely with the Account Executives to build an accomplished pipeline of potential customers. Business development representatives will build their prospects through phone, email, and LinkedIn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
