&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Project Management Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional organizational ability with deep attention to detail and a passion for turning campaign delivery friction into smooth, predictable, and scalable workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative AI &amp;amp; Automation Application:&lt;/strong&gt; A tech-forward operational mindset with a passion for staying on top of the rapid changes in AI and modern automation tools, and the creativity to apply these technologies to solve complex GTM business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Attribution Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong conceptual understanding of Looker (or comparable modern BI platforms) to navigate dashboards and interpret data, alongside a solid grasp of multi-touch attribution models to evaluate campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
