&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-Acquisition System &amp;amp; Process Awareness: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience or familiarity with post-acquisition environments, bringing a strong understanding of how merging with a large enterprise business impacts systems, lead processes, and shared pipeline targets.&lt;/li&gt;
