&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;511&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;Wiz is looking for a dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Director, Strategic Partners &lt;/strong&gt;to build our Systems Integrator sell-business. The ideal candidate is a quota-carrier and has a background in selling to the world’s largest system integrators. He/she also will have significant experience in collaborating cross-functionally with the internal sell-through, sell-with, and SI services organization to create a comprehensive partner consumption and partner GTM integrated engine. This is your opportunity to join the fastest growing cloud security company. If you want to experience explosive growth, and to be given responsibility and challenge to impact a company’s success, this opportunity is for you.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting to the RVP, Systems Integrator Alliances, success will be accomplished by establishing working relationships with the SI Alliances organization, internal East/West Wiz supporting functions, and SI customer organizations.&lt;/div&gt;
