&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with SI Alliances org and practice build consultant team to drive aligned sell-to, sell-with, sell-through, advisory and implementation services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build champions at both the business and technical levels in the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage their business in alignment with the core RSM value sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that internal consumption motion drives external sell-through and sell-with partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
