&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;511&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;134&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Global Partner Marketing Programs Manager to lead our With and Through go-to-market strategy across our global partner ecosystem (GSIs, MSPs, Channel, Tech Alliances, and CSPs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;337&quot;&gt;In this role, you will serve as a principal pipeline driver for global partner marketing by architecting and scaling high-impact Global Pipeline Plays, Joint Account Activation campaigns, and executive engagement platforms—including Partner Advisory Boards and C-level roundtables—across our partner ecosystem. By engineering repeatable, programmatic GTM models that regional teams can seamlessly adapt, you will directly accelerate account activation, expand global co-sell revenue, and maximize overall partner marketing ROI, moving beyond tactical event execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
