&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2347&quot;&gt;Joint Demand Generation &amp;amp; Global Pipeline Plays: Own the development and rollout of global With/Through-Partner programs including GTM kits and demand-generation campaigns that partners can easily execute to drive Wiz pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2576&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Solution Messaging: Partner with Product Marketing, Field Global Programs, and Partner Sales to build compelling joint solution messaging, campaign/event-in-a-box kits, and customer-facing assessments/workshops that partners and partner marketers can execute.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2854&quot;&gt;GTM Play Optimization: Continuously optimize GTM plays by tracking partner usage, partner pipeline metrics, and ROI to scale high-performing programs globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3015&quot;&gt;Account Activation &amp;amp; ABM Co-Marketing: Lead Account Activation strategies in close alignment with Regional Partner Marketers and Partner Managers, leveraging partner relationships to unlock target accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3223&quot;&gt;Targeted Account Campaigns: Design and deploy targeted ABM programs, joint executive briefings, and account-mapped campaigns that drive and accelerate pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3385&quot;&gt;Process Standardization: Standardize programs (kits, campaigns) to ensure a consistent, sophisticated &quot;Wiz&quot; brand experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3512&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence: Build scalable repeatable processes to ensure a predictable demand gen engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
