&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;330&quot;&gt;Minimum of 2+ years of experience in SaaS or security sales, selling to SMB or Mid-Enterprise accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
