&lt;p&gt;At Wiz, we&#39;re passionate about technical sales and helping our partners and their customers achieve maximum value. This starts with a team effort, collaborating with all available Wiz resources and teaming with the best partners in the world.&amp;nbsp; Cloud transformation isn&#39;t slowing down, and with the explosion of autonomous AI agents, frontier models, and multi-tenant cloud architectures, the demand for next-generation MSP and MDR services is shifting overnight. We don&#39;t react to trends, we set the standard.&amp;nbsp; As a &lt;strong&gt;Partner Solutions Architect (MSP)&lt;/strong&gt;, you won&#39;t just be supporting sales deals; you will influence and execute our technical MSP strategy from the ground up. Sitting at the absolute bleeding edge of technology, you will serve as the lead technical strategist empowering top-tier Managed Service Providers to rethink cloud security, package high-margin Wiz-powered offerings, and protect their clients&#39; multi-cloud estates with the power of the Wiz Security Graph and our agentless architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
