&lt;li&gt;Enable the broader support and field teams by building and maintaining investigation runbooks, internal knowledge base content, and onboarding materials. Lead regular thought leadership sessions to share insights derived from customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Wiz sales teams on strategic opportunities to demonstrate the platform&#39;s technical and business value. Assist SEs and prospects during the POV process with advanced use cases, installation, deployment, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
