&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;Leverage product acumen to identify repeatable field patterns and friction points, converting them into reusable modules, architecture blueprints, or formal product feature requests for the Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
