&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;422&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in Product Security, Cloud Security Engineering, or DevSecOps.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;545&quot;&gt;Experience with AWS platforms and services (equivalent experience in Azure and GCP also considered), Kubernetes (AWS EKS), and container infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with foundational cloud networking (VPCs, Security Groups) and cloud IAM at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience writing Infrastructure as Code (Terraform) and developing security scripts/automation in Python, Go, or Shell.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;998&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
