&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;Experience leading Threat Modeling and Security Architecture Reviews with software engineering / R&amp;amp;D teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud detection, security monitoring, and live Incident Response operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Experience with CNAPP, CSPM, or CIEM solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
