&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;About t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;he Job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1427&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Security Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;- Wiz Product to spread the power of Wiz. The ideal candidate will have experience performing security reviews, vulnerability management, and detection and response operations in cloud-native environments. You’ll get to collaborate with our software development and DevOps teams to secure Wiz’s products, CI/CD infrastructure, and production infrastructure. You’ll also have the opportunity to influence our product roadmap by utilizing Wiz-for-Wiz to assess, monitor, and harden our environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead threat modeling and security design reviews with R&amp;amp;D and Product teams - identifying and mitigating architecture risks early in the development lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive vulnerability management and remediation - actively writing IaC (Terraform), submitting code PRs, and developing security automations (Python/Go) to resolve risks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Extend cloud detection and response capabilities - authoring detection rules, monitoring cloud environments, and investigating live security incidents across our production infrastructure&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as &quot;Customer Zero&quot; by leveraging Wiz to protect Wiz - dogfooding new product features in our massive multi-cloud environment and directly shaping the product roadmap.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with our DevOps and Wiz Federal teams -&amp;nbsp; hardening CI/CD pipelines, container/Kubernetes infrastructure, and extending security controls to FedRAMP environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Enable engineering teams to deliver secure-by-design cloud and AI solutions without slowing down development velocity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
