&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;At least 4 years’ experience of success in Program Management, Product Management, or Business Systems roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2117&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing GTM systems strategy, with a focus on optimizing systems and processes that largely tie back to Salesforce, BI, and agentic tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2276&quot;&gt;A detail-oriented and process-driven mindset, with proven experience documenting processes, designing workflows, and managing projects with a structured, detail-focused approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2456&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to create polished, simplified summaries where appropriate for senior stakeholders while also getting into the weeds with individual contributors working through daily pains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1893&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2729&quot;&gt;Strong familiarity with Customer Engineering, Sales Engineering, or Solutions Engineering workflows (running proofs of value &amp;amp; customer workshops, customer handoffs to technical account managers, et al).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2934&quot;&gt;A willingness to actively participate in co-designing revenue systems in partnership with members of the business and engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3072&quot;&gt;A strong personal passion for revenue technology and leveraging it to maximize productivity in a business setting, coupled with unwavering empathy for our internal stakeholders and the external customers they support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3291&quot;&gt;A willingness to lean into both strategic and tactical execution, and the ability to discern which is most appropriate to solve a pain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3428&quot;&gt;Ability to balance immediate needs with a future vision, manage around ambiguity, and resourcefully create processes to support complex systems, prioritizing solutions that make the most impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;511&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;402&quot;&gt;The GTM Systems team at Wiz is looking for a strategy-focused technologist to support our Customer Engineering team in demonstrating our value to our potential and existing customers. This person will have the unique opportunity to support one of our most technical GTM teams scale their impact as we continue to evolve the cybersecurity landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;753&quot;&gt;As a Senior GTM Systems Analyst, you will play a key role in shaping the Systems strategy and roadmap as a business partner for our CEs. You’ll be responsible for owning a scalable, high-impact technology strategy that supports efficient, customer-focused processes. You’ll foster strong cross-functional relationships to ensure alignment, prioritize innovation, and drive continuous improvement toward world-class GTM solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2378&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Work closely with internal stakeholders to understand needs, address pain points, and prioritize requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1314&quot;&gt;Oversee systems project lifecycles from intake through to completion, partnering cross-functionally with GTM, IT, Procurement, BI, Product and Development teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;Pair GTM strategy with scalable technology for the team you support, ensuring our best-in-class teams are met with a best-in-class technology ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1631&quot;&gt;Balance an AI-driven future state with the need to “keep the lights on” today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1711&quot;&gt;Remove silos across GTM teams by focusing on shared functionality, applying role-based context to existing systems where possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;Establish yourself as a key resource within the GTM team for best practices and industry standards around scaling through technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Compensation + Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
