&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1082&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of multi-channel execution across webinars, digital events, direct mailers, executive roundtables, and content syndication campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Exceptional collaboration skills with a track record of driving alignment across global field teams, PMM, CXO, digital, and revenue organizations in a matrixed environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
