&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;511&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;118&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Global Marketing Programs Manager to join the Field and Partner Marketing team at Wiz. In this role, you will report to the Manager of Global Programs &amp;amp; ABM and serve as a strategic leader within the Integrated Marketing organization. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;380&quot;&gt;You will collaborate directly with cross-functional partners—including Product Marketing, Campaigns, Field Marketing, CXO, Digital, and Sales/BDR teams—to translate Wiz’s product innovation and campaign themes into scalable global programs. Your mission is to bridge high-level strategy with regional execution, designing high-impact initiatives and turnkey frameworks that drive demand, accelerate pipeline attribution, and support executive-level campaign priorities (targeting CISOs and CIOs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2378&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1963&quot;&gt;Bridge Strategy &amp;amp; Field Execution: Serve as the connective tissue between Product Marketing (PMM), Campaigns, and regional Field Marketing, translating global messaging pillars and product launches into integrated program playbooks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Execute Multi-Channel Demand Programs: Design, launch, and manage scalable global initiatives—such as Meeting Makers, Direct Mailers, Virtual Research Summits, and persona-aligned Webinar series—to drive pipeline growth and target whitespace penetration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2453&quot;&gt;Build &amp;amp; Support Executive Campaigns: Partner closely with CXO and Campaign teams to design, build, and deploy strategic programs tailored to executive buyer narratives (CISO, CIO), driving C-suite engagement and high-value pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Deploy Templatized Initiatives for Scale: Build and maintain turnkey &quot;Event-in-a-Box&quot; frameworks and playbooks that empower regional field teams to localize and execute programs with high consistency and minimal friction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2910&quot;&gt;Support Customer Expansion: Collaborate on campaigns designed to educate the install base and drive adoption/upsell for key product expansion motions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;Measure, Optimize, &amp;amp; Enable: Standardize program reporting and post-campaign assessments. Equip regional Field Marketing and Sales/BDR teams with actionable insights, lead enablement assets, and clear SLAs to maximize pipeline conversion within the 90-day window.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Compensation + Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
