&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Voice of the Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate the multi-tenancy and massive scale requirements of top GSIs back into actionable product requirements. Partner directly with R&amp;amp;D to push the boundaries of what our platform can do.&lt;/li&gt;
