&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4342&quot;&gt;Proven ability to think strategically, prioritize ruthlessly, problem solve, and execute independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4449&quot;&gt;Project management skills to manage multiple priorities in a dynamic environment, with a willingness to roll up your sleeves and get scrappy in a startup environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;732&quot;&gt;About the job:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;746&quot;&gt;In this role, we are looking for an experienced product marketer to drive the business and go to market to support the rapid growth of Wiz. This includes owning the product go to market strategy for one of our product areas, creating compelling messaging and positioning, launching new features, enabling the field teams, and partnering with marketing and revenue to target the right buyers and influencers. The ideal candidate will have deep prior experience in cloud threat detection or intelligence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
