&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;334&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;358&quot;&gt;7+ years of hands-on Salesforce administration experience, with 5+ years focused deeply on enterprise-scale Salesforce CPQ or Agentforce Revenue Management (ARM) in a high-growth SaaS or enterprise tech ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;573&quot;&gt;Direct experience writing, testing, and debugging custom JavaScript within the Salesforce CPQ Quote Calculator Plugin (QCP) to execute advanced pricing algorithms that exceed declarative limits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Expert-level mastery of Price/Product Rules, Bundles, Summary Variables, Custom Actions, and Advanced Approvals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;883&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Salesforce Flow architecture, design patterns, and platform limits, adhering to scalable enterprise best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of Quote-to-Cash lifecycles, contract amendments, renewals, co-terming, multi-currency quoting, and downstream billing/revenue recognition touchpoints.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
