&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1204&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1230&quot;&gt;Proven experience integrating generative AI coding and reasoning tools into day-to-day configuration, script generation, and testing workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;Exceptional diagnostic capability to trace and resolve calculation bottlenecks, execution loop issues, and data anomalies across declarative rules and custom scripts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;Track record of driving technical initiatives autonomously within an Agile/Scrum environment, utilizing Jira or similar platforms to manage technical debt, sprint deliverables, and release cadences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to articulate technical constraints, trade-offs, and design patterns to non-technical business leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;The Business Systems Team is central to Wiz&#39;s operational excellence and growth, ensuring the reliability and evolution of key business systems that support critical functions across the organization. Composed of technical administrators, developers, and analysts, the team focuses on maintaining and optimizing these business systems to drive efficiency and effectiveness. Combining strategic oversight with tactical execution, the Business Systems Team directly contributes to the success of Wiz&#39;s core business objectives as the company scales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2457&quot;&gt;As a Senior Revenue Systems Administrator, you will serve as a primary technical owner of our Quote-to-Cash architecture, with a deep focus on Salesforce CPQ. This role sits at the critical intersection between Go-to-Market, Finance, and Product. You will lead the design, implementation, and optimization of complex pricing engines, product catalogs, and contracting pipelines. Combining deep declarative mastery with programmatic customization, you will build resilient, highly scalable revenue systems while leveraging modern AI developer tooling to accelerate solution delivery and automate operational workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3078&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3096&quot;&gt;Own the administration, architecture, and continuous enhancement of Salesforce CPQ, translating complex commercial models into scalable, maintainable system solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3265&quot;&gt;Design, develop, test, and maintain custom JavaScript within the CPQ Quote Calculator Plugin (QCP) to execute advanced pricing algorithms, complex bundle configurations, and conditional calculations that exceed standard declarative capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3512&quot;&gt;Architect, build, and optimize intricate Price Rules, Product Rules, and search filters, ensuring optimal quote performance, calculation speed, and zero data discrepancies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3686&quot;&gt;Build and govern robust, enterprise-grade Salesforce Flows and process automations, strategically evaluating trade-offs between native declarative features and programmatic interventions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3875&quot;&gt;Leverage cutting-edge AI development environments to accelerate scripting, prototype complex logic, refactor legacy configurations, and triage system issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4083&quot;&gt;Partner closely with business stakeholders to drive end-to-end Q2C enhancements, triage escalated production blockers, and provide technical guidance and mentorship to junior administrators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4275&quot;&gt;Lead sandbox lifecycle management, deployment strategies, and version control using enterprise Gearset Pipelines to enforce rigorous testing protocols and release hygiene.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
