&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1230&quot;&gt;About the Job:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1246&quot;&gt;As a Senior Technical Account Manager (TAM), you&#39;ll be responsible for planning and executing strategies to drive customer adoption and use of the Wiz platform. You will provide both strategic and hands-on technical guidance to customers throughout the Wiz journey, from onboarding to operationalisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Serving as the bridge between customers and the broader Wiz team, you&#39;ll streamline collaboration between Product Management, Sales, Engineering and Support for a cohesive customer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1744&quot;&gt;Join Wiz as a Senior TAM to contribute to customer success and to be a part of an innovative and collaborative company that values excellence and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
