&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3553&quot;&gt;Strong strategic thinking and self-directed execution, with a track record of leading projects with impact rather than activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;732&quot;&gt;About the job:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;746&quot;&gt;In this role, we are looking for someone who will lead strategic technical narratives, own GTM efforts for key initiatives, and mentor others on content and enablement. You have deep, hands-on experience in one or more of these domains: Kubernetes and containerized infrastructure, Cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP), DevOps and CI/CD pipelines, Cloud security and detection engineering, AI infrastructure and governance, and Data protection and regulatory compliance.You’re not just a content creator — you’re a trusted technical voice in the room, with strong instincts for how to reach practitioners and translate complexity into clarity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1300&quot;&gt;Define and execute the technical marketing plan for one or more product areas, from launch to scale, owning technical go-to-market for strategic areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;Lead technical storytelling and content development, driving the creation of deep-dive blogs, demo environments, whitepapers, technical sessions, and diagrams grounded in hands-on expertise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1649&quot;&gt;Build cross-functional influence as a key partner to Product, Product Marketing (PMM), Sales Engineering, and Enablement, helping to define messaging, guide roadmap feedback, and scale GTM impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1849&quot;&gt;Enable the field and drive adoption by creating and delivering tools that drive sales conversations and help customers adopt the platform, including battlecards, investigation flows, objection handling, and workshops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2070&quot;&gt;Represent Wiz externally at webinars, industry events, and customer briefings, becoming a go-to voice for your domain internally and in the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Mentor and scale the team by sharing best practices, reviewing content, and helping level up a growing Technical Marketing Manager (TMM) team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
