&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;Familiarity with REST APIs or GraphQL.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1560&quot;&gt;Knowledge of basic web technologies (e.g., HTTP, HTML, DNS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1622&quot;&gt;Understanding of networking fundamentals (e.g., TCP/IP, Routing, VPNs, VLANs, Peering, Load Balancing).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
