&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2290&quot;&gt;Own, troubleshoot, and solve customer technical issues using collaboration, troubleshooting best practices, and transparency within and across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2441&quot;&gt;Identify cases that require escalation (either technically or strategically).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;Create, maintain, and coordinate incident management requests to product or engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;Design and implement solutions that scale the support offering through automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;Participate in on-call rotation for after-hours, holiday, and weekend support coverage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
