&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record in a partner-facing technical sales, Solutions Architecture, or Sales Engineering role within cloud security or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on technical background in container security, Kubernetes, virtual machines, and cloud operating systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of DevOps workflows, CI/CD pipelines, and integrating security guardrails into developer ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
