&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;As a Senior Partner Solutions Architect – CSP, APJ based in Singapore, you will serve as the dedicated pre-sales technical counterpart to our CSP Alliance Manger, driving our technical go-to-market strategy across AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure. In this role, you will build and execute joint technical strategies from the ground up, establishing deep alignment between Wiz and CSP partner engineering teams across the APJ theater.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;As the trusted advisor and cloud security SME, you will educate, inspire, and enable CSP Partner Solutions Architects, cloud specialists, and security practitioners to position the Wiz + CSP joint value proposition. You will lead technical enablement initiatives—including hands-on joint workshops and interactive Capture The Flag (CTF) events—to win technical mindshare and build architectural preference among developers, cloud architects, and enterprise security leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;At Wiz, we view technical sales as a team sport. You will collaborate seamlessly with regional field sales, product teams, and CSP partner ecosystems to accelerate co-sell adoption and help mutual customers solve complex cloud security challenges at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
