&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive the pre-sales technical alliance strategy across APJ with major Cloud Service Providers (CSPs)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Deliver high-impact technical enablement, deep-dive architectural workshops, and hands-on Capture The Flag sessions tailored to CSP Solutions Architects, developers, and security practitioners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Act as the primary technical advisor for CSP partner teams, helping them integrate and recommend Wiz into enterprise cloud reference architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Partner with CSP Alliance leadership to deliver technical co-sell wins, support architectural validations, and engage executive stakeholders at CSP EBCs and regional forums.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Present at major industry summits, CSP partner events, and executive technical briefings across APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Wiz Product and Engineering teams to channel feedback from CSP technical engagements into our joint integrations and product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,6,0&quot;&gt;Travel up to 40% across APJ for CSP partner workshops, customer co-sell sessions, and enablement summits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
