&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting complex technical issues and driving resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to effectively engage with stakeholders at all levels of an organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
